				"Welcome, future Governor."
				""
				"Somewhere out there is a valley that will one day be the heart of an empire. For now, you need a place to put four settlers and a dream."
				""
				"Craft (or find in your starter gear) the Supply Camp and deploy it on open ground — it contains everything needed to found a colony."
